# core.autocrlf is on for this repo, which is right for source but wrong for
# binaries: without these rules Git rewrote the bytes of a committed PDF on
# checkout and the file came back with a broken cross-reference table.
# Marking them binary stores and restores them verbatim.
*.pdf   binary
*.docx  binary
*.png   binary
*.jpg   binary
*.jpeg  binary
*.gif   binary
*.ico   binary
*.woff  binary
*.woff2 binary
